508 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (HybridDEX is a next-generation decentralized exchange protocol that combines the best features of two major trading models: the liquidity aggregation of traditional order books and the automation and fairness of Automated Market Makers \(AMMs\). Unlike traditional DEXs or CEXs, HybridDEX uses a dynamic order book combined with an intelligent pricing mechanism to ensure that trades are executed fairly, with low slippage and improved liquidity.)
/E (HybridDEX is a next-generation decentralized exchange protocol that combines the best features of two major trading models: the liquidity aggregation of traditional order books and the automation and fairness of Automated Market Makers \(AMMs\). Unlike traditional DEXs or CEXs, HybridDEX uses a dynamic order book combined with an intelligent pricing mechanism to ensure that trades are executed fairly, with low slippage and improved liquidity.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In simple terms, HybridDEX provides a decentralized exchange environment that behaves similarly to a centralized exchange in terms of execution speed, price discovery, and liquidity aggregation, but operates in a trustless, decentralized manner.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
