516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Price Manipulation and Volatility: Traditional AMMs like Uniswap are vulnerable to price manipulation because their price discovery is based on simple formulas \(e.g., x * y = k\), which can be easily influenced by large trades. This often leads to price inefficiencies and slippage. HybridDEX uses an aggregated order book and a weighted average price \(WAP\) with a fair price window, minimizing slippage and preventing manipulation. This ensures that prices remain stable and reflect real market conditions.)
/E (Price Manipulation and Volatility: Traditional AMMs like Uniswap are vulnerable to price manipulation because their price discovery is based on simple formulas \(e.g., x * y = k\), which can be easily influenced by large trades. This often leads to price inefficiencies and slippage. HybridDEX uses an aggregated order book and a weighted average price \(WAP\) with a fair price window, minimizing slippage and preventing manipulation. This ensures that prices remain stable and reflect real market conditions.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
